            "inputs": [],
            "outputs": [],
            "properties": {},
            "widgets_values": [
              "## H3 Continuum EZ Studio — FastH3 OmniRef\n\nComfyUI 0.44.0 / frontend 1.57.6で確認。モデル読込のPDD対応はComfyUI 0.42.0から。\nValidated with ComfyUI 0.44.0 / frontend 1.57.6. Baked-PDD checkpoint loading requires ComfyUI 0.42.0 or later.\n\nNVIDIAではCUDA 13対応のPyTorch（cu130以上）とComfyUI指定のcomfy-kitchenを使用。このNVFP4 AWQエンコーダー自体はBlackwell専用ではありません。ネイティブNVFP4高速化は対応GPU・カーネルに依存します。\nFor NVIDIA, use a cu130-or-newer PyTorch build and ComfyUI's pinned comfy-kitchen. This NVFP4 AWQ encoder is not Blackwell-only; native NVFP4 acceleration depends on compatible hardware and kernels.\n\nEuler / simple / 8 steps / video shift 12 / audio shift 3 / VSA 10% / comfy kitchen attention。追加LoRAは不要です。\nNo additional Pika LoRA is needed. Keep this workflow's model and sampling connections.\n\n- [fasth3_omniref_8step_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastH3-Omni-Comfy/resolve/main/diffusion_models/fasth3_omniref_8step_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/p-h3-image-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n\nモデル名はサブグラフで実際の導入先に合わせて選択。画像はStudioで追加します。P-H3はAI文章生成用の任意モデルで、未導入でも原文で動画を生成できます。\nSelect the installed filenames on the subgraph and add your media in Studio. P-H3 is optional for AI text; Original works without that model.\n\n[日本語](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README_JA.md) · [English](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README.md)\n"
            ],
            "widgets_values_named": {
              "text": "## H3 Continuum EZ Studio — FastH3 OmniRef\n\nComfyUI 0.44.0 / frontend 1.57.6で確認。モデル読込のPDD対応はComfyUI 0.42.0から。\nValidated with ComfyUI 0.44.0 / frontend 1.57.6. Baked-PDD checkpoint loading requires ComfyUI 0.42.0 or later.\n\nNVIDIAではCUDA 13対応のPyTorch（cu130以上）とComfyUI指定のcomfy-kitchenを使用。このNVFP4 AWQエンコーダー自体はBlackwell専用ではありません。ネイティブNVFP4高速化は対応GPU・カーネルに依存します。\nFor NVIDIA, use a cu130-or-newer PyTorch build and ComfyUI's pinned comfy-kitchen. This NVFP4 AWQ encoder is not Blackwell-only; native NVFP4 acceleration depends on compatible hardware and kernels.\n\nEuler / simple / 8 steps / video shift 12 / audio shift 3 / VSA 10% / comfy kitchen attention。追加LoRAは不要です。\nNo additional Pika LoRA is needed. Keep this workflow's model and sampling connections.\n\n- [fasth3_omniref_8step_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastH3-Omni-Comfy/resolve/main/diffusion_models/fasth3_omniref_8step_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/p-h3-image-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n\nモデル名はサブグラフで実際の導入先に合わせて選択。画像はStudioで追加します。P-H3はAI文章生成用の任意モデルで、未導入でも原文で動画を生成できます。\nSelect the installed filenames on the subgraph and add your media in Studio. P-H3 is optional for AI text; Original works without that model.\n\n[日本語](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README_JA.md) · [English](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README.md)\n"
            },
